{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0084_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6a85cab9997d5f45cb6f0252760d4b9340cd244751133c36c074fac0ad3bad4b", "ja": "（今日は美希と、大手アパレルブランドのCM収録に\nきている。今は休憩時間だ）", "zh": "（今天跟美希来拍摄知名服饰品牌的广告，\n现在是休息时间。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0084_1001_p", "source_sha256": "0ecc7943b7a500fbf30d7ba82d9dada5f32fe0dd6cb810859befaccf45e857e9", "ja": "美希、お疲れさま。\n調子いいみたいだな。", "zh": "美希，辛苦你了。\n你的状况好像不错呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0084_1002_003mik", "source_sha256": "38222eed3afc2e99e5a30d3a6df265d7df795eba0b383585399ad9fe477d2369", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}。\nお疲れさまなの～。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n辛苦了唷～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0084_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "51b3d8a53ef9f02497c51b9d0a2f5dd657688cd65e03fffcf36f03e1589514ea", "ja": "ミキ、今日はけっこーやる気ってカンジなんだよ？\nだってハニーが～、じ～って見ててくれるから♪", "zh": "美希今天感觉很有干劲哦，\n因为HONEY～一直目不转睛地～看着人家♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0084_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8ae0873f7dd08b59dc4b35e1a004f461d85b4405cf160fafdc162944bbd4f43a", "ja": "ま、まあ、撮影だからな……。\nというか美希、仕事先でその呼び方は……。", "zh": "毕、毕竟是来拍摄广告的……\n是说美希，别在工作场合这样称呼我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0084_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "440cdb0c8af3b70264e413248426b67ef0a606d7ca083789c59ffc45853e11ca", "ja": "あはっ、小声だからヘーキなの☆\nねえねえ、ドキドキした？", "zh": "啊哈，小小声说没关系唷☆\n欸欸，HONEY是不是心动了一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0084_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2ff7bd97b9f221ab30eef413f7fc02b92ef4c7ea66c1c7920293d79cb3b764e2", "ja": "ドキドキっていうかヒヤヒヤしたよ。\nまあ、わかってくれてるならいいけど。", "zh": "与其说是心动，不如说是提心吊胆。\n总之，你明白就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0084_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "8d8f3e554fbc7ce3867ac422b950b7133ca27f0797a0162f6ecb50ffb048f3f5", "ja": "ミキいい子だから、安心していいって思うな♪\n続きの撮影も、ちゃんとがんばるね！", "zh": "美希是乖孩子，HONEY大可放心唷♪\n接下来的拍摄，美希也会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0084_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "72fc5a6bb27f9608aeef1a3da386e661c2924752fd36d064a9839718ccd37899", "ja": "そのかわり～。\n早く終わったら、どっか遊びに行こ♪", "zh": "不过相对地～\n要是工作提早结束，就找个地方一起去玩吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0084_1009_staff", "source_sha256": "bbe7856dfe56560f782b95d02694891a27f5ac5a9910c21615d6d05064c326e7", "ja": "いたいた、すみません765プロさん！\nちょっと打ち合わせ、いいですか？", "zh": "找到了找到了，765艺能的先生，不好意思！\n方便跟你讨论一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0084_1010_p", "source_sha256": "762d1d876cb14da9c88e2c637570c35761c4b2940e8afe3a591943e77c7fb7b7", "ja": "あ、はい！\n美希、ちょっと行ってくるから。", "zh": "啊，好的！\n美希，我过去一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0084_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "e3d2cc764b1beae2053e4ac194c5336807bb4f0da8bb84083a8fb1faa1128fcb", "ja": "え～。\n今、ミキとお話ししてたのに……む～。", "zh": "怎么这样～\nHONEY和美希还没讲完耶……唔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0084_1012_p", "source_sha256": "679965df9bbce1355fdd3bc465189709f0c11410c07568fd700b38f9fb9170fb", "ja": "ごめんごめん、すぐ戻るよ。\nはーい、いま行きます！", "zh": "抱歉抱歉，我马上回来。\n好～我这就过去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0084_1013_p", "source_sha256": "82b6eb9a7ca2ae06281a937cc135e1845e596b71d07f173f53f9bc76868366f9", "ja": "（……かなり長引いてしまった。\n美希は、大人しくしてくれてるだろうか……？）", "zh": "（……讨论比预期中还花时间，\n不晓得美希有没有乖乖等我……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0084_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "ba419aeefd04586ba00fed3025374564104a30d3d5b61aab2c7a10b2cbdb3a9d", "ja": "あ、{$P$}、お帰りなさいなの♪\nお話、終わった？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}，欢迎回来唷♪\n事情讨论完了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0084_1015_p", "source_sha256": "af70bd5ffa897d0477423562cdc94b8bacd2e9a3171918c2bef28dc32c68d430", "ja": "ああ、ちょっと長くなったけど、やっと終わったよ。\nさっきは話の途中だったのに、ごめんな。", "zh": "嗯，虽然有点讨论太久，但总算结束了。\n刚才跟你讲到一半就离开，抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0084_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "3609677db14d0365796cc68c0c23ed14369b8f347dfe8a4c941ff2e10943e1f1", "ja": "ううん、ミキいい子だから、別に怒ってないよ♪\nでも、ずーっとほったらかしだったから～……。", "zh": "没关系，美希是乖孩子，没有生气唷♪\n可是，因为HONEY一直把美希晾在旁边……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0084_1017_p", "source_sha256": "cf60e61f489b37dd95f7f9751d8ac6a8e25672f18cae07033104270129e2354e", "ja": "えっ……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0084_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "7c1821e94411db2a3a327f0e8a6a6eb4667c73691300a7c2fc9fa0f298d21622", "ja": "ミキ、元気も消えちゃった……。\n眠くなってきちゃったかも……。あふぅ。", "zh": "所以美希也没有活力了……\n好像有点想睡……啊呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0084_1019_p", "source_sha256": "48897e4cb205d20292624591d105214b1c4fbc4b7c5b600f244a337886f3c33a", "ja": "い、いや、それは困る！　美希、悪かったって！\nそうだ、おにぎり、おにぎりを買いに……！", "zh": "不、不行，这样我会很伤脑筋！美希，对不起啦！\n对了，饭团，我去买饭团……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0084_1020_003mik", "source_sha256": "e049bfeb9062b7165daffe787d445160241e131e62b6a9a992a736b92394e505", "ja": "……。\n……あはっ☆", "zh": "……\n……啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0084_1021_003mik", "source_sha256": "ddd522fd48e6f824a5eceddc252a45686dac1b4c9fdd8e36724c8e0023b70704", "ja": "ダイジョーブだよ、{$P$}！\nちょっとイジワルだったの、ごめんなさい。", "zh": "没事的，{$P$}！\n美希只是想捉弄你一下，对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0084_1022_003mik", "source_sha256": "614519641d394c13b653d3927ef14303b9c442a8485a7cc23aa085226da2d245", "ja": "心配しなくても、ミキいい子だから。\nおにぎりで許してあげる♪", "zh": "不用这么担心，美希是乖孩子。\n有饭团就原谅你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0084_1023_p", "source_sha256": "37891ccb1f3b030c9c4cf1433b211a5b03c4c87620aa28320867372a802ba394", "ja": "そ、そうか。おにぎりは要るんだな……。\nいや、ありがとう。", "zh": "这、这样啊，原来还是要吃饭团……\n没事，谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0084_1024_003mik", "source_sha256": "f806ab366688750fe71f8c5e0ddaa0a77230e2d543cb50340bbf29368c6c57f7", "ja": "どーいたしましてなの♪\nそれじゃミキ、続きもいっぱいがんばるね！", "zh": "不～用客气唷♪\n那美希要继续加油工作啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0084_1025_003mik", "source_sha256": "d35c00bc8256214c58af91f54f70a6e8d5a8a2024cb27d22ee60272a14d1be8b", "ja": "スタッフさんもハニーも、ほっとけないくらい。\n本気のミキ、見せてあげる！　あはっ☆", "zh": "美希要拿出真本事，让工作人员还有HONEY，\n都不能再把目光从美希身上移开！啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0084_1026_p", "source_sha256": "4a1434f99804bbbdc567f603c73827e3baf339cf7b025d67c6b3ae95968a522c", "ja": "美希……。\nあ、こら、その呼び方は……！", "zh": "美希……\n啊，真是的，别这样称呼我……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0084_1027_p", "source_sha256": "05e9e31db405028e263cce2360533deede8586cc66d57a45e8e43f373eaeeb5d", "ja": "（その後、美希は宣言どおり、放っておけない存在感を\n見せてくれた。本当に目が離せないな…色々な意味で）", "zh": "（之后，美希就如她所宣言的，展现了不容忽视的\n存在感。确实让人不能把目光移开……在各种意义上。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
